# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day21

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| budget | 예산 | The company increased its marketing budget. |
| expense | 비용 | Travel expenses will be reimbursed. |
| revenue | 수익, 매출 | The company's revenue increased this year. |
| afford | ~할 여유가 있다 | We cannot afford a new machine. |
| reduce | 줄이다 | The company wants to reduce costs. |

